  "source_snippet": "module GenericInferenceSuccess\n\nfunction max\u003cT\u003e(a: T, b: T) returns T\nrequires T is Comparable\nis\n    if a \u003e b then\n        return a\n    else\n        return b\n    end if\nend max\n\nprocedure main()\nis\n    let x: Integer = max(3, 4)\n    let y: Double = max(5.0, 2.0)\nend main\n\nend GenericInferenceSuccess\n",
